                "urpx:name": "CARE-discountable subtotal for DR-SES. The 13 bill components the CARE percentage discount applies to, which Schedule E-CARE Sheet 1 defines as the bill less any applicable exemptions, minimum bill amount and base services charge. Excludes the fixed charge, and excludes the DWR Bond Charge and the California Wildfire Fund Non-Bypassable Charge because a CARE customer is exempt from both.",
